Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Marlow says I owe him forty-seven cranks.\NI counted the lift chains myself. There are only twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:11.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,I woke up underground with a headache\Nand a rat going through my pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:17.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The kid's name is Nib. He failed to rob me,\Nso now he's my problem. His words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:22.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then the possum showed me the lift.\NOne crank per paid debt. Forty-seven debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:26.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twelve chains. I counted.\NSo either the possum can't do math —
